# Keep the two runnable title projects trackable: p5_feb16 (TEST00000 ID,
# XRD664 label) and
# p5_npeb02436 (NPEB02436). Build trees and executables remain ignored above.
# Raw PPU/SPU translation units emitted directly from a title EBOOT or its
# embedded SPU ELF images stay local; surrounding files remain trackable.
**/ppu_recomp.h
**/ppu_recomp.c
**/ppu_recomp.cpp
**/ppu_recomp_*.c
**/ppu_recomp_*.cpp
**/ppu_recomp.cpp_*.cpp
**/spu_recomp.c
**/spu_recomp.h

# Decryption keys
*.keys
*.rap

# OS files
.DS_Store
Desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Harness batch-run outputs (per-title JSON, work dirs, REPORT.md)
_harness/
.pr_review/
_drill/

# Local Claude Code settings
.claude/

# macOS packaging output
*.dmg

# Gate builds: a port (or the toolkit) built against the toolkit under test,
# kept separate from the developer's own build/ so a gate run cannot be fooled
# by a stale binary. See tools/regress.py.
build-gate/

# Scratch space for generated test drivers and their output (test_ppu_lift.py,
# test_milestone.py).
scratch/

# SPU differential test build products (runtime/spu/tests/build_diff_test.sh)
runtime/spu/tests/build_diff/
